## 📖 What I Learned

This lab strengthened my understanding of the Windows operating system by introducing its core components, built-in utilities, and security features. It provided hands-on experience with managing files, checking system information, monitoring system resources, and understanding how Windows protects devices using built-in security tools. These concepts form the foundation for Windows administration, IT support, and cybersecurity.

